# Develop {{project_name}}

Parent: [Documentation index](README.md)

This project uses the `{{profile}}` TemplateRepo profile. Python 3.11 or newer
runs repository tooling. PowerShell and POSIX shell files are only platform
entrypoints into Python. VS Code recommendations in `.vscode/extensions.json`
are optional and scoped to this profile.

## Set up

Run `scripts/setup.ps1` from PowerShell or `scripts/setup.sh` from a POSIX shell.
The setup command is idempotent and changes only this project directory.

## Run checks

Run `scripts/check.ps1` from PowerShell or `scripts/check.sh` from a POSIX shell.
The command first validates repository and documentation structure, then runs
the profile-specific build and smoke tests.

## Tool ownership

`scripts/project.py` owns repository-wide orchestration. The profile's
`scripts/dev.py` owns only runtime-specific setup and checks. Keep this page
concise and link to those scripts instead of duplicating their command sequence.
